T1  - Keyworker mediated enhancement of physical health in patients with first episode psychosis: A feasibility/acceptability study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/eip.13234
A1  - Broughan, John
A1  - McCombe, Geoff
A1  - Lim, Jayleigh
A1  - O'Keeffe, Donal
