T1  - Home-based virtual reality for chronic pain: protocol for an NIH-supported randomised-controlled trial.
T3  - Comment in: J Urol. 2022 Dec;208(6):1329-1330. doi: 10.1097/JU.0000000000002947 PMID: 36047283 [https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36047283]
