T1  - Integrating Electronic Health Record, Cancer Registry, and Geospatial Data to Study Lung Cancer in Asian American, Native Hawaiian, and Pacific Islander Ethnic Groups.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1158/1055-9965.EPI-21-0019
A1  - DeRouen, Mindy C
