T1  - Characterizing Self-Reported Tobacco, Vaping, and Marijuana-Related Tweets Geolocated for California College Campuses.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3389/fpubh.2021.628812
A1  - Cuomo, Raphael E
A1  - Purushothaman, Vidya L
A1  - Li, Jiawei
