T1  - Investigating foods and beverages sold and advertised in deprived urban neighbourhoods in Ghana and Kenya: a cross-sectional study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/bmjopen-2019-035680
A1  - Green, Mark Alan
A1  - Pradeilles, Rebecca
A1  - Laar, Amos
