T1  - Telephone health coaching with exercise monitoring using wearable activity trackers (TeGeCoach) for improving walking impairment in peripheral artery disease: study protocol for a randomised controlled trial and economic evaluation.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/bmjopen-2019-032146
A1  - Rezvani, Farhad
A1  - Heider, Dirk
A1  - Harter, Martin
