T1  - Geospatial mapping and resource utilization tool in support of a national smoke-free public housing rule.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s13104-019-4815-x
A1  - Tetlow, Sonia
A1  - Gurbaxani, Brian
A1  - Graffunder, Corinne
