T1  - Cohort profile: the Hortega Study for the evaluation of non-traditional risk factors of cardiometabolic and other chronic diseases in a general population from Spain.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/bmjopen-2018-024073
A1  - Tellez-Plaza, Maria
A1  - Briongos-Figuero, Laisa
