T1  - [Psoriatic patients: Analysis of patients dissatisfied with their management].
T2  - Patients atteints de psoriasis : analyse de la population insatisfaite de sa prise en charge.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.annder.2017.03.025
A1  - Mahe, E
A1  - Maccari, F
A1  - Beauchet, A
A1  - Quiles-Tsimaratos, N
A1  - Beneton, N
A1  - Parier, J
A1  - Barthelemy, H
A1  - Goujon-Henry, C
A1  - Chaby, G
A1  - Thomas-Beaulieu, D
A1  - Gener, G
A1  - Wagner, L
A1  - Pallure, V
A1  - Devaux, S
