T1  - Geographic variation in the treatment of non-ST-segment myocardial infarction in the English National Health Service: a cohort study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/bmjopen-2016-011600
A1  - Dondo, T B
A1  - Hall, M
A1  - Timmis, A D
A1  - Yan, A T
