T1  - Distribution of the Population at Risk of Cholangiocarcinoma in Bua Yai District, Nakhon Ratchasima of Thailand Using Google Map.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.7314/apjcp.2016.17.3.1433
A1  - Kaewpitoon, Soraya J
A1  - Rujirakul, Ratana
A1  - Sangkudloa, Amnat
