T1  - Global cardiovascular risk evaluation: pattern of algorithm use and risk modification in 'real life'.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.2459/JCM.0000000000000124
A1  - Filippi, Alessandro
A1  - Giampaoli, Simona
A1  - Lapi, Francesco
