T1  - Implementing guidelines to routinely prevent chronic vascular disease in primary care: the Preventive Evidence into Practice cluster randomised controlled trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/bmjopen-2015-009397
A1  - Harris, Mark Fort
A1  - Parker, Sharon M
A1  - Litt, John
A1  - van Driel, Mieke
A1  - Russell, Grant
A1  - Mazza, Danielle
A1  - Jayasinghe, Upali W
A1  - Del Mar, Chris
A1  - Lloyd, Jane
